name: porthole
display name: porthole tunnel client
description: porthole tunnel client daemon: keeps tunnels to a portholed server up and serves the local API.
command line: "C:\Program Files\porthole\porthole.exe" daemon --config C:\ProgramData\porthole\config.yaml --tunnels C:\ProgramData\porthole\tunnels.yaml --allow porthole-users
account: LocalSystem
start type: automatic, delayed
error control: normal
recovery 1: restart after 1s
recovery 2: restart after 5s
recovery 3: restart after 30s
recovery reset period: 24h0m0s
recovery on non-crash failures: true
event log source: porthole (error, warning, information)
